---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { siteConfig as site } from '../data/site';
import { guides } from '../data/service-guides';
import { pricingDraft } from '../data/pricing';
if (!pricingDraft.approved) return new Response('Page not found', {status:404});
---
<BaseLayout site={site} title="Visiting From Durham Region? Manicures in Scarborough" description="Visiting Bianca from Durham Region? Compare dry manicures, structured gel and soft gel tips, and plan your first visit to her Scarborough home studio." photo={{img:'/images/pricing-red-manicure-720.webp',alt:'Glossy burgundy manicure on short square nails'}}>
<div class="page-shell" id="top"><Header site={site}/>
<main id="main"><section class="welcome"><div><p class="eyebrow">Bianca’s Scarborough home studio</p><h1>Visiting from Pickering, Ajax or Whitby?</h1><p>I welcome clients from across Durham Region for one-on-one manicures in Scarborough. If you’re looking for a Russian manicure, you’ll find my dry combi service on the menu under European Dry Manicure.</p></div><img src="/images/pricing-red-manicure-720.webp" alt="Short square nails finished in glossy burgundy" /></section>
<section class="visit"><h2>Which appointment is worth the trip?</h2><ul>{guides.filter(g => ['dry', 'structured', 'soft-gel-tips'].includes(g.id)).map((g,i)=><li><a href={g.path}>{g.label}</a><p>{['Choose cuticle care and shaping with a bare finish. Allow 45–60 minutes for the $45 CAD appointment.','Choose a builder-gel overlay for support at your natural length. Short nails with solid colour start at $75 CAD and take 90–120 minutes.','Choose full-cover tips for extra length, from $65 CAD. Send your reference photo so I can confirm the time and price.'][i]}</p></li>)}</ul>
<h2>Can I book a gel manicure if I live in Pickering, Ajax or Whitby?</h2>
<p>Yes. Your appointment is with Bianca at her home studio in Scarborough. For solid colour on your natural nails, the <a href="/services/gel-manicure-scarborough">European Gel Manicure</a> is $60 CAD and takes 75–90 minutes. For a pink base with white tips, see <a href="/services/nail-art-scarborough#short-french-tips">Bianca’s short French manicure and its starting price</a>.</p>
<h2>Before you travel to Scarborough</h2><p>Request a weekday appointment and wait for me to confirm your time and studio details before setting out. A $30 deposit goes toward your appointment. If another technician applied your current gel, arrive with bare nails or request removal so I can allow extra time.</p><nav><a href="/services-pricing">See the full price list</a><a class="button" href="/#booking">Request an appointment</a></nav></section></main><Footer site={site}/></div></BaseLayout>
<style>
.welcome{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:5vw;align-items:center;background:#330505;color:#fff0cb;padding:9rem 5vw 4rem}.welcome h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,5vw,5.5rem);line-height:1.05;margin:1rem 0}.welcome img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover;border-radius:1rem}.visit{max-width:48rem;margin:auto;padding:4rem 1.25rem}.visit ul{padding-left:1.25rem;margin:1rem 0 3rem}.visit li{margin-bottom:1.25rem}.visit nav{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2rem;margin-top:2rem}.visit a{text-decoration:underline}p{line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:800px){.welcome{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
